    "status": "rejected",
    "notes": "Needs more deffrenatiators between levels in terms of functionality and decoration id also like it to expand more get bigger with a grand hall and throne for the king",
    "author": "claude",
    "created": "2026-10-10T03:32:23.908Z",
    "description": "Keep, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. A grand stone keep after the approved sample: 15 x 15 on a cobblestone apron, four corner towers with corbelled tops, a gatehouse with an arched passage, battlements on corbels, a great hall with a throne, tables and a hearth, stairs (no ladders) to the king's rooms and the roof deck. 16 tall: needs scaffold in game. Not yet builder-tested: candle, cracked_stone_bricks, dark_oak_fence, iron_bars, mossy_stone_bricks, red_banner, red_wall_banner, stone_brick_slab.",
    "changes": "Dark oak ties it to the kingdom look: a dark oak door frame (level 1) and low dark oak pyramid roofs that close the four tower tops (level 1, no more open boxes); level 3 now has its own feature, timber hoardings (dark oak posts and pent roofs) over every battlement.",
    "parent": 2,
    "reviewedAt": "2026-10-10T03:36:22.944Z",
